宜同吏禮，詣神虎門奉牋致謁；年節稱慶，亦同如此。婦人無閫外之事，賀及問訊牋什，所由官報聞而已。夫婦人之道，義無自專，若不仰繫於夫，則當俯繫於子。榮親之道，應極其所榮，未有子所行而所從不足者也。故《春秋》凡王命爲夫人，則禮秩與子等。列國雖異於儲貳，而從尊之義不殊。前代依准，布在舊事。貴嬪載誕元良，克固大業，禮同儲君，實惟舊典。尋前代始置貴嬪，位次皇后，爵無所視；其次職者，位視相國，爵比諸侯王。此貴嬪之禮，已高朝列；況母儀春宮，義絕常算。且儲妃作配，率由盛則；以婦逾姑，彌乖從序。謂貴嬪典章，一與太子不異。","subject_person_reference_id":"c-liangshu-007-dinglingguang:p003:r0032","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-007-dinglingguang:p003:m0035","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-007-dinglingguang:p003","surface":"帝所生陳太妃","start":32,"end":38}}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"泰豫元年時新帝即宋後廢帝。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-liang007-dinglingguang-c-father","subject_person_id":"989_en9_fv0_A","object_person_id":"989_en9_fv0","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"太妃父金寶","liang007_dinglingguang_reading":"c-father","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-041","source_id":"s-songshu-041-dinglingguang-chen-rank-ws2634831","chapter_id":"c-songshu-041-dinglingguang-chen-rank","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-041-dinglingguang-chen-rank:p003","quote":"追贈太妃父金寶散騎常侍","subject_person_reference_id":"c-songshu-041-dinglingguang-chen-rank:p003:r0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-041-dinglingguang-chen-rank:p003:m0005","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-songshu-041-dinglingguang-chen-rank:p003","surface":"太妃父金寶","start":2,"end":7}}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"太妃父金寶。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"person_references":[{"id":"c-songshu-041-dinglingguang-chen-rank:p001:r0002","surface":"陳貴妃","start":2,"end":5,"person_id":"989_en9_fv0_A","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-041-dinglingguang-chen-rank:p001","quote":"明帝陳貴妃諱妙登，丹陽建康人，屠家女也。","note":"依其直接稱謂與章內人物。","chapter_id":"c-songshu-041-dinglingguang-chen-rank","book_id":"b-songshu-041","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-041-dinglingg